0:{"buildId":"A2KDDaJI2Oei_cuPJJym6","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","main",null,{"className":"blog-page","children":[["$","$L2",null,{}],["$","article",null,{"className":"blog-article","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"shell blog-article-shell","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"className":"blog-back-link","href":"/blog","children":[["$","$L4",null,{"iconNode":[["path",{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7","key":"1l729n"}],["path",{"d":"M19 12H5","key":"x3x0zl"}]],"className":"lucide-arrow-left","size":16}]," All guides"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-tag","children":["Destinations"," · ","One Window archive"]}],["$","h1",null,{"children":"Europe Is Quietly Becoming the Smartest Place to Study Abroad"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-article-intro","children":"A real talk about why thousands of students every year pack up, head to Europe, and never look back, and why you might want to join them. From AI labs in Helsinki to climate innovation hubs in Amsterdam,  why the world’s brightest students choosing Europe to shape the future?"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-article-body","children":[["$","section","The Case for Europe",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"The Case for Europe"}],[["$","p","When most students think about going abroad for university, they picture two places: the US or the UK. Big names. Big campuses. Big price tags. But here’s what nobody tells you early enough: Europe has quietly become one of the most exciting, affordable, and genuinely life-changing places in the world to get a degree. And a lot of students are figuring this reality out too late.",{"children":"When most students think about going abroad for university, they picture two places: the US or the UK. Big names. Big campuses. Big price tags. But here’s what nobody tells you early enough: Europe has quietly become one of the most exciting, affordable, and genuinely life-changing places in the world to get a degree. And a lot of students are figuring this reality out too late."}],["$","p","I’m not talking about some nostalgic “study in a medieval town and find yourself” fantasy. I’m talking about world-class research labs, programs taught entirely in English, cities that run on clean energy, and, in some countries, completely free tuition in public universities. Yes, even for international students.",{"children":"I’m not talking about some nostalgic “study in a medieval town and find yourself” fantasy. I’m talking about world-class research labs, programs taught entirely in English, cities that run on clean energy, and, in some countries, completely free tuition in public universities. Yes, even for international students."}],["$","p","Quick reality check:",{"children":"Quick reality check:"}],["$","p","A full master’s degree in Germany or Norway can cost you less than one semester’s tuition at a mid-tier American university. The quality? Frequently higher. Let that sink in.",{"children":"A full master’s degree in Germany or Norway can cost you less than one semester’s tuition at a mid-tier American university. The quality? Frequently higher. Let that sink in."}],["$","p","“The university of the future is not a building, it is a borderless intellectual ecosystem.",{"children":"“The university of the future is not a building, it is a borderless intellectual ecosystem."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}],["$","section","And Europe, right now, is building exactly that.”",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"And Europe, right now, is building exactly that.”"}],[["$","p","— Education Futures Forum, Davos 2025",{"children":"— Education Futures Forum, Davos 2025"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}],["$","section","So, Why Now? What’s Changed?",{"children":["$L5",["$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12"],"$L13"]}],"$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e"]}],"$L1f"]}]}],"$L20"]}],["$L21"],"$L22"]}],"isPartial":"$@23","staleTime":"$24","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L25","isPartial":"$@26","staleTime":"$24","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L27","isPartial":"$@28","staleTime":"$24","varyParams":"$29"},{"rsc":"$L2a","isPartial":"$@2b","staleTime":"$24","varyParams":"$29"},{"rsc":"$L2c","isPartial":"$@2d","staleTime":"$24","varyParams":null}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@2e","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@2f"}
