5:["$","h2",null,{"children":"So, Why Now? What’s Changed?"}]
6:["$","p","The timing actually matters here. The world is going through a massive shift. AI is changing every industry, climate change is reshaping what careers look like, and the ability to work across cultures and borders is no longer a “nice to have.” It’s essential.",{"children":"The timing actually matters here. The world is going through a massive shift. AI is changing every industry, climate change is reshaping what careers look like, and the ability to work across cultures and borders is no longer a “nice to have.” It’s essential."}]
7:["$","p","European universities have moved fast to respond to all of these changes. They’re not just adding AI modules to old degrees; they’re building brand new programmes where students work alongside AI tools from day one. Climate science, green engineering, and circular economy thinking isn’t an elective here; it’s baked into the curriculum across nearly every field.",{"children":"European universities have moved fast to respond to all of these changes. They’re not just adding AI modules to old degrees; they’re building brand new programmes where students work alongside AI tools from day one. Climate science, green engineering, and circular economy thinking isn’t an elective here; it’s baked into the curriculum across nearly every field."}]
8:["$","p","And the geopolitical reality? Studying in Europe, surrounded by 26 different countries, dozens of languages, and students from over 120 nationalities, that’s not just education. That’s training for the world you’re actually going to work in.",{"children":"And the geopolitical reality? Studying in Europe, surrounded by 26 different countries, dozens of languages, and students from over 120 nationalities, that’s not just education. That’s training for the world you’re actually going to work in."}]
9:["$","p","50+ countries",{"children":"50+ countries"}]
a:["$","p","sending students to Europe",{"children":"sending students to Europe"}]
b:["$","p","4M+ international",{"children":"4M+ international"}]
c:["$","p","students enrolled in EU",{"children":"students enrolled in EU"}]
d:["$","p","40% more",{"children":"40% more"}]
e:["$","p","AI research papers from EU vs 2020",{"children":"AI research papers from EU vs 2020"}]
f:["$","p","26 countries",{"children":"26 countries"}]
10:["$","p","in the Schengen travel zone",{"children":"in the Schengen travel zone"}]
11:["$","p","Six Reasons",{"children":"Six Reasons"}]
12:["$","p","to Choose Europe",{"children":"to Choose Europe"}]
13:["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]
14:["$","section","01 Radically Low Tuition",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"01 Radically Low Tuition"}],[["$","p","Germany, Norway, and Finland charge little to no tuition for international students. France and Austria offer world-class education for a few hundred euros per year,  a revolution in academic access.",{"children":"Germany, Norway, and Finland charge little to no tuition for international students. France and Austria offer world-class education for a few hundred euros per year,  a revolution in academic access."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
15:["$","section","02 AI & Deep Tech Labs",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"02 AI & Deep Tech Labs"}],[["$","p","From ETH Zurich’s robotics halls to Stockholm’s fintech incubators, European campuses are where the next generation of transformative technology is actually being built, not just theorised.",{"children":"From ETH Zurich’s robotics halls to Stockholm’s fintech incubators, European campuses are where the next generation of transformative technology is actually being built, not just theorised."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
16:["$","section","03 Green Futures at the Core",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"03 Green Futures at the Core"}],[["$","p","Climate science, renewable energy, and circular economy design are woven into programmes across disciplines. Study engineering in Denmark and you will work on wind farm simulations as a first-year student.",{"children":"Climate science, renewable energy, and circular economy design are woven into programmes across disciplines. Study engineering in Denmark and you will work on wind farm simulations as a first-year student."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
17:["$","section","04 One Continent, Infinite Campuses",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"04 One Continent, Infinite Campuses"}],[["$","p","The Erasmus+ programme lets students move freely between partner universities across 33 countries, often with grants to cover travel and living costs. Your degree can span three countries.",{"children":"The Erasmus+ programme lets students move freely between partner universities across 33 countries, often with grants to cover travel and living costs. Your degree can span three countries."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
18:["$","section","05 The World in One Classroom",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"05 The World in One Classroom"}],[["$","p","European cities are among the world’s most culturally layered. Study alongside peers from 120 nationalities and leave with a global network  and a genuinely multicultural worldview.",{"children":"European cities are among the world’s most culturally layered. Study alongside peers from 120 nationalities and leave with a global network  and a genuinely multicultural worldview."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
19:["$","section","06 Institutions With Centuries of Depth",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"06 Institutions With Centuries of Depth"}],[["$","p","The University of Bologna was founded in 1088. Oxford in 1096. These are not just credentials; they are living intellectual traditions that continue to shape how knowledge is created and shared.",{"children":"The University of Bologna was founded in 1088. Oxford in 1096. These are not just credentials; they are living intellectual traditions that continue to shape how knowledge is created and shared."}],["$","p","The Movements Reshaping European Education",{"children":"The Movements Reshaping European Education"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
1a:["$","section","01 Human-AI Collaborative Degrees",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"01 Human-AI Collaborative Degrees"}],[["$","p","From Helsinki to Barcelona, universities are building programmes where students don’t just study AI  they use it as a research partner. You learn to direct it, question it, and govern it ethically. That’s a fundamentally different kind of education than reading a textbook about machine learning.",{"children":"From Helsinki to Barcelona, universities are building programmes where students don’t just study AI  they use it as a research partner. You learn to direct it, question it, and govern it ethically. That’s a fundamentally different kind of education than reading a textbook about machine learning."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
1b:["$","section","02 The Climate Campus Revolution",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"02 The Climate Campus Revolution"}],[["$","p","Sustainability isn’t a buzzword. The EU’s Green Deal has funnelled billions into academic research infrastructure. New interdisciplinary schools of “planetary health” are emerging that combine ecology, economics, law, and engineering into programmes designed explicitly to address the climate emergency.",{"children":"Sustainability isn’t a buzzword. The EU’s Green Deal has funnelled billions into academic research infrastructure. New interdisciplinary schools of “planetary health” are emerging that combine ecology, economics, law, and engineering into programmes designed explicitly to address the climate emergency."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
1c:["$","section","03 New Model: Studying in four campuses at once",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"03 New Model: Studying in four campuses at once"}],[["$","p","The EU’s flagship academic project links over 60 university alliances across member states into transnational institutions. Students in one country can earn joint degrees with peers on four campuses simultaneously, a genuinely new model of higher learning that has no parallel elsewhere in the world.",{"children":"The EU’s flagship academic project links over 60 university alliances across member states into transnational institutions. Students in one country can earn joint degrees with peers on four campuses simultaneously, a genuinely new model of higher learning that has no parallel elsewhere in the world."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
1d:["$","section","04 Quality of Life as a Learning Metric",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"04 Quality of Life as a Learning Metric"}],[["$","p","Scandinavian universities now treat student wellbeing as a core educational outcome. Flexible schedules, mental health integration, work-life balance policies, and universal healthcare coverage mean that studying in Europe is not just intellectually enriching; it is restorative.",{"children":"Scandinavian universities now treat student wellbeing as a core educational outcome. Flexible schedules, mental health integration, work-life balance policies, and universal healthcare coverage mean that studying in Europe is not just intellectually enriching; it is restorative."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
1e:["$","section","05 English-Taught Programmes Explode",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"05 English-Taught Programmes Explode"}],[["$","p","Over 10,000 fully English-taught Master’s programmes now operate across continental Europe,  a fourfold increase since 2015. The language barrier that once dissuaded international students has largely dissolved, opening the continent to a truly global cohort.",{"children":"Over 10,000 fully English-taught Master’s programmes now operate across continental Europe,  a fourfold increase since 2015. The language barrier that once dissuaded international students has largely dissolved, opening the continent to a truly global cohort."}],["$","p","✦ ✦ ✦",{"children":"✦ ✦ ✦"}],["$","p","The best education is the one that changes",{"children":"The best education is the one that changes"}],["$","p","not just what you know —",{"children":"not just what you know —"}],["$","p","but who you become.",{"children":"but who you become."}],["$","p","Europe offers centuries of wisdom, a living laboratory of cultures, and front-row access to the technologies defining the next hundred years. The question is no longer why you should come. It is why you would go anywhere else.",{"children":"Europe offers centuries of wisdom, a living laboratory of cultures, and front-row access to the technologies defining the next hundred years. The question is no longer why you should come. It is why you would go anywhere else."}],["$","p","A Final Word",{"children":"A Final Word"}],["$","p","Europe does that. Living and studying in a place where history, innovation, and radical openness coexist affects you. It stretches you in the best possible way.",{"children":"Europe does that. Living and studying in a place where history, innovation, and radical openness coexist affects you. It stretches you in the best possible way."}],["$","p","The students who are going to lead things in the 2040s are deciding where to study right now. Some of them will choose safely and locally. Others will choose an education that takes them somewhere new and challenges their beliefs.",{"children":"The students who are going to lead things in the 2040s are deciding where to study right now. Some of them will choose safely and locally. Others will choose an education that takes them somewhere new and challenges their beliefs."}],["$","p","Pack your bags. The continent is waiting.",{"children":"Pack your bags. The continent is waiting."}],["$","p","FAQs",{"children":"FAQs"}],["$","p","Europe is becoming a popular choice because it offers high-quality education, lower tuition in many countries, strong career opportunities, and access to multicultural learning environments.",{"children":"Europe is becoming a popular choice because it offers high-quality education, lower tuition in many countries, strong career opportunities, and access to multicultural learning environments."}],["$","p","Yes, many European countries offer affordable tuition, and some public universities charge little to no tuition fees. Compared to other major study abroad destinations, Europe can be a more cost-effective option.",{"children":"Yes, many European countries offer affordable tuition, and some public universities charge little to no tuition fees. Compared to other major study abroad destinations, Europe can be a more cost-effective option."}],["$","p","Yes, thousands of programmes across Europe are taught entirely in English, especially at the master’s level, making it easier for international students to apply without needing to learn a new language first.",{"children":"Yes, thousands of programmes across Europe are taught entirely in English, especially at the master’s level, making it easier for international students to apply without needing to learn a new language first."}],"$L30","$L31","$L32","$L33","$L34","$L35","$L36"],"$L37"]}]
